WEBVTT

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:46.370
You were scolded by Mother?

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:50.330
She said, "You're so very
different from your older sister."

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:53.550
You can do it.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:57.720
Don't cry.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:01.180
This is what I think.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:04.470
The strength of ones
feelings will exceed talent.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:05.810
Exceed?

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:09.730
It means to overcome. It's not just talent,

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:12.520
but destiny, and even people's deaths.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:17.110
I believe that strong
feelings can overcome everything.

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:20.070
That's why, Satella,

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:25.700
I want you to love
the jewels more than I do.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:49.480
Take this with you.

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.070
This is...

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:01.160
Using special transcription technology,

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:04.780
I've engraved ancient Enochian
characters into the blade portion.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:07.410
With this, you should be
able to cross swords with Aion

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.290
on equal terms, even in that form.

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.290
Thank you.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:16.050
It's nothing. Right now,
the Order is powerless against Aion.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.380
They can't even stop you
from trying to go out alone,

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.680
or go to give you support.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.050
Mr. Elder...

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.850
Be sure to use that to end it.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:31.350
No matter what happens,
don't return to your normal form.

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:34.270
If you do revert,
then Rosette's life will likely...

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.320
You understand, don't you?

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:12.980
Lord Joshua...

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.230
That's brilliance...

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:25.700
Hold on!

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:27.780
This is...

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:33.080
What in the world? Where's Joshua?

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.620
Sister Kate...

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:39.550
I'm sorry, Fiore got away.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:42.130
Then this is her doing.

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.920
It happened so suddenly.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.180
She destroyed the entire wall,
and she and Joshua...

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:50.060
That's enough talk.
Take them to the infirmary, and hurry.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:50.510
Yes, Ma'am.

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.560
Where could Miss Fiore have gone?

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.350
To where Aion is.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:57.940
I'm sure that's where
my older sister is going.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.820
I just know it.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.030
Let's hurry.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.790
Lord Joshua, it's just a little further.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:17.000
I'll protect you, no matter what.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.290
No matter what...

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.970
All right, and you're done.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.970
Thank you!

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.350
What?!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:36.390
Yes! Yes! We'll begin immediately!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:37.650
What's wrong?

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:39.650
You see, Joshua's...

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:44.900
That's hot!

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.780
And now we have even more work.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.620
And? What was that call about?

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:54.910
Oh, right. You see, Joshua has
gone missing from the 'Cisco branch.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:00.830
That's...

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:01.840
No way...

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:08.550
Rosette...

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.140
Are you all right?

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:19.230
It must be hard for you,
having an injury like that.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:21.730
Please don't worry.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.320
I'm sure that this misfortune
will change into a blessing.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.160
Oh, it doesn't hurt!

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:40.120
What?

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:46.300
Oh, a miracle.
It's a miracle. It's truly a miracle!

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:50.340
Thank you, thank you!

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.090
Go with God's blessing.

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.890
Rosette!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:01.060
We were worried!
Where have you been up until now?

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:03.940
Oww...

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:05.070
Are you all right?

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:05.980
Huh?

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.360
I-I'm sorry!

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:11.280
Oh, Mary, it's because you're so careless.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.490
Rosette...

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.160
We're going.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.290
Aion!

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:21.670
Thank you.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.920
R-Rosette?

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:37.890
It's the Virgin Mary.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:41.520
Yes, she's the true Holy Mother.

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:42.980
It's not a dream, right?

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.400
It's the Savior! We're saved!

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:46.900
God has descended!

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.230
The Holy Mother...

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:50.530
It's an angel!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:51.570
Rosette...

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.530
I see. Please continue what you're doing.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.700
Have they found Joshua and Fiore?

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:00.700
Not yet.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.000
I'm going out too.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.500
Did you find them?!

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:09.670
What did you say?

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:14.010
I understand, continue, just as you are.

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.260
What is the matter?

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:20.890
The Sinner Aion has appeared
alongside Rosette Christopher.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.600
I wonder if something has happened?

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.060
Chrono!

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:30.780
Girls!

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.490
Why are you here?

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.700
We followed those people.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:39.160
Chrono, actually,
we don't understand, but you see...

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.200
Rosette is...

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.950
It's the Holy Mother!

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.290
Holy Mother!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.670
Please save us!

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.920
Please save us from this pain!

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:52.380
Rosette... Aion...

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:04.480
Chrono...

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:07.770
There they are.

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:11.940
Fiore!

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.820
Don't move, older sister!

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:17.320
Oh...

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:21.580
This too is an interesting combination.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:34.130
Let Joshua go.

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:37.510
Lord Aion will be able to save Lord Joshua.

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.760
If you go to him,
he'll just kill the two of you.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:43.890
Lord Aion needs my brilliance.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:46.060
He won't kill us.

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.980
I'll take care of my older sister.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:51.610
Once you've rescued Joshua,
go immediately to where Rosette is.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:10:01.330
Seize her, like the grape vines
that proclaim their ripeness!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.000
The Abundant October!

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.220
I won't let you get away anymore,

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:27.600
older sister.

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.560
Why?

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:34.270
Why do you ally yourself
with Aion so, older sister Florette?

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:36.240
My name is Fiore.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:40.740
Florette!
Your name is Florette Harvenheit!

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:41.740
No...

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:47.910
I'm just a doll, just a shadow.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:03.600
Mother! Mother!

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:08.020
Leave this place!
I won't let you do as you wish any longer!

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:26.080
Older sister!

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:57.230
Big sister...

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:04.490
I continue to exist to protect Lord Joshua.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:08.330
The one you protected
was your younger sister! Me!

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:12.620
Why don't you realize that Aion
has switched your memories around?

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:34.560
It can't be. How could she do that
inside of a barrier and without any jewels?

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:45.360
Please! Stop it, older sister!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:48.870
Return to your senses.
Return to the way you were!

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:58.710
Please! I don't want to fight you!

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:02.920
As long as you don't release
this barrier, I'll show you no mercy!

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:04.550
There we go.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.430
Okay then, I'm counting on you, Anna.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.600
Leave it to us. Okay, we're going.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:10.600
Okay!

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:21.900
So you've come...

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:28.570
There's no need to worry.
The Lord is always by your side.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:29.570
Rosette...

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:36.420
What did you do to Rosette?!

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:38.500
I haven't done anything.

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:41.340
She's doing this because she wishes to.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:44.920
She hands out mercy
and miracles in Magdalene's place,

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:47.630
all for her own atonement.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:51.260
Chrono, not here!

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.770
You'll get everyone
around us caught up in it.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:57.560
Aion...

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:01.230
Let's get going.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.230
As you wish.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.420
Chrono!

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:24.550
What's going on?

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.340
Something's happened to the Holy Mother.

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:30.680
What's with him? He isn't normal.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.260
It couldn't be a devil?

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:34.970
That's right, he's a devil.

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.560
Why is one here?

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.600
He tried to touch the Holy Woman!

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.440
Take a look,

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:44.690
a fake cannot get past the power
of the Lord, no matter what form it takes.

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:47.990
He will reveal his true nature himself!

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:52.450
Those who do not know the Lord
cannot even touch the Holy Woman!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.330
He intends to befoul the Holy Woman!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:56.500
He's a devil! Kill the devil!

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.210
Kill the devil!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:00.670
What the?
There's the mark of the Magdalene Order!

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.920
Is the church in cahoots with them too?

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:04.040
After him!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:28.570
Please, older sister, stop it already!

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:32.990
Your older sister,
Florette, died ten years ago.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:38.830
I am the fleeting rage that
Florette left behind in this world.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:44.880
I am a doll that
Lord Aion made from that corpse.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.510
Instead of things like weak flesh,

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:50.510
a hard jewel is in the place of my heart.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:51.590
It can't be...

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:54.760
As long as I have it,
I can continue to go on forever.

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:55.550
No way...

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:57.970
I can continue to be
Lord Joshua's older sister.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.220
That's a lie!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:05.560
Feelings can overcome everything,
destiny, and even people's deaths.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.730
Is this what you meant?!

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:10.690
Then where did my older sister go?!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.710
Give me back my older sister!

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:45.480
No matter what you do,
it's useless, because I'm a doll.

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.480
Do you need me to end this?

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:34.070
It's not over yet...

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:39.660
If... if you can't come back any more,

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:18.660
Satella...

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.600
It looks like they're
not following us anymore.

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:46.270
Miss Satella...

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:51.690
Satella!

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:57.440
Chrono... Azmaria...

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:01.780
What's wrong? Where's Rosette?

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:06.450
Azmaria...

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:09.080
It's no use.

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:15.250
Chrono, go after her.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:19.630
Rosette is like me, bound by the past.

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:26.600
Cut that bond, quickly,
before she ends up like me.

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:30.980
Satella...

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:37.320
I'd like to hear a song.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:41.570
Please, Azmaria...

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.250
Minister Gilliam!

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:41.840
Send out the devil!

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.170
It's no use hiding him!

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:44.800
You damned band of heretics!

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:47.220
Repent for your
blasphemy against the Lord!
